    "conventions": {
      "coordinates": "metres, centre origin, team-attacking direction: the team attacks +x, left is +y; pitch 105 x 68 m",
      "validity": "valid samples only (valid_kinematics = true); estimated gap samples never count for speed, peaks or per-90 values",
      "per90": "normalised on measured (valid) time of each player-match (team decision 2026-10-24); see coverage",
      "ball": "ball status and possession are the provider's (never derived from a stationary ball)"
    },
    "notes": ["Event types are the provider's (DFL taxonomy, Delete already dropped at load). per90_per_team: STATS over team-matches (zeros included) of the count per 90 minutes of match time (sum of the tracked period durations, stoppage time included). Team attribute: Team, else WinnerTeam (TacklingGame), else TeamFouler (Foul). Types without a team (KickOff, FinalWhistle, RefereeBall, VideoAssistantAction) are in per90_per_match.", "Zones: 6 x 4 in the acting team's attacking coordinates (team attacks +x, left is +y); keys x{ix}y{iy}, ix 0 = own goal end, iy 0 = right flank.", "Locations: the ball at the synchronised frame where the event was located, otherwise the annotated provider coordinates converted to the canonical frame (on-ball actions: {'annotated': 1781, 'sync_frame': 5302}).", "pass: open-play Play events (set-piece passes are nested in their restart events). Length, success, direction and speed use located passes only. Success = the next touch (from the ball trajectory) is by a team-mate; annotated_success_share is the provider's Evaluation for comparison. Direction: ball at the kick -> ball at the next touch (or where the ball went dead), degrees, 0 = straight forward, +90 = to the left; signed angles do not average well, so direction_sector_share_by_zone gives the share per 45-degree sector. high_share is the annotated Height = high share; height_check compares it with the ball height.", "transitions: P(next on-ball action zone | current zone) within the same possession chain. Chain = consecutive on-ball actions (Play, ShotAtGoal, OtherBallAction, BallClaiming, restarts) of the same team in the same period; a restart starts a new chain and a shot ends one. possession_end_share_by_zone: share of actions in a zone that are the last of their chain.", "shot: open-play ShotAtGoal events (penalties and direct free kicks are separate DFL events). rate_per_possession_by_zone = shots from the zone / chains with an action in the zone; rate_per_action_by_zone = shots from the zone / on-ball actions in the zone. outcome_shares and head_share are the annotated SubType and TypeOfShot.", "possession: runs of the provider's ball possession while the ball is live (a run ends when possession changes or the ball goes dead); passes_per_sequence counts the possessing team's Play events inside the run (located frame, else the corrected event time). Very short runs are kept (duels make possession flicker): see share_shorter_than_1s and passes_per_sequence_at_least_1s. Set-piece passes are nested in their restart events and are not counted as Play. passes_per_event_chain / actions_per_event_chain use the event chains of 'transitions' (closer to the usual 'passes per possession').", "ball_in_play_share: provider ball status live time / tracked time, all matches pooled."]
  },
